          <h2 id="operator-gen-heading" class="heading-lg">Developing the Next Generation of Operators</h2>
          <div class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <p class="body-md">As experienced equipment operators retire or leave the industry, employers need a way to develop the skills of the people taking their place. TRG offers an in-person training outlet for organizations building their snow removal teams. The focus is on the equipment operators maintain, use and operate. Training serves airports of any size and municipalities with snow and ice removal vehicles and equipment.</p>
