<section class="section section--pad" aria-labelledby="operator-areas-heading">
  <div class="panel panel--soft">
    <div class="trg-editable" data-trg-editable>
      <div class="trg-editable__fallback">
        <h2 id="operator-areas-heading" class="heading-lg">Three Areas of Operator Training</h2>
        <div class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="body-md">Discuss the following areas in relation to your equipment and your team’s current experience.</p>
        <div class="info-grid">
          <article class="info-card">
            <span class="num-badge">01</span>
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Equipment Maintenance</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Equipment maintenance is part of TRG’s operator training offering. Discuss the vehicles your team uses and the maintenance knowledge your operators need to develop so the training scope can be defined.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <span class="num-badge">02</span>
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Proper Equipment Use</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">TRG provides instruction on the proper use of airport and municipal snow removal equipment. Share the equipment your operators work with and where they need further guidance when discussing the training requirements.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <span class="num-badge">03</span>
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Equipment Operation</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Operator training addresses the use and operation of snow removal vehicles and equipment. Explain your team’s existing experience and training goals to discuss the instruction that fits your organization.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trg-editable__cms">
        <squarespace:block-field id="snowRemovalOperatorTrainingAreas" columns="12" label="EDIT: Three Areas of Operator Training" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

